' DeepSeek baseline: 0a53fb55bea101816fa226bb964ae2bed71c343b (alpha).
' Source: packages/todo/tool-todo/src/index.ts :: apply, execute; whole-list replacement.
' Observed behavior: Java commits generic results at the existing TurnEndEvent boundary.
